# Stores safety

This Cursor rule supplements the repository AGENTS.md instructions. It may add scoped requirements but may not weaken root security invariants.

**Authority:** [`packages/stores/AGENTS.md`](../../packages/stores/AGENTS.md) · root [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md)

## Do not

- Store secrets or decrypted vault material in any Zustand store
- Add fields named or equivalent to `FORBIDDEN_SESSION_KEYS`: `password`, `mnemonic`, `privateKey`, `encryptionKey`, `rawSeed`, `decryptedVault`
- Persist `useSessionStore` (must stay in-memory)
- Write key material to localStorage

## Pattern anchors

### BAD

```ts
type SessionState = {
  mnemonic: string;
  isUnlocked: boolean;
};

persist(createStore, { name: "session" });
```

### GOOD

```ts
type SessionState = {
  isUnlocked: boolean;
  activeAccountIndex: number;
};

// Session store: in-memory only — no persist() middleware
export const useSessionStore = create<SessionState>(() => ({
  isUnlocked: false,
  activeAccountIndex: 0,
}));
```
